The '''Main Vault fortress'''<ref name="Slide 4">{{SW|url=crisis-at-the-heart-episode-gallery|text=Crisis at the Heart Episode Gallery}} {{C|Slide 4}}</ref> was a [[city]] located on the [[planet]] [[Scipio]]<ref name="Crisis" /> that housed [[Main Vault|one]] of the [[InterGalactic Banking Clan]]'s primary vaults.<ref name="Scipio">{{Databank|scipio|Scipio}}</ref> It was [[Invasion of Scipio|invaded]] by the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] and then the [[Galactic Republic]] during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="Crisis" />

